# HR Hospital Management

HR Hospital is an Odoo module for managing hospital operations including doctors, patients, visits, and diseases.

## Features
- Doctor management with categories and mentor/intern structure
- Patient records with assigned doctors and history
- Visit scheduling (planned, done, cancelled)
- Disease directory with hierarchy
- Calendar, pivot, and list views for analytics
- Wizards for mass doctor reassignment and visit reports

## Models
- hr.hospital.doctor
- hr.hospital.patient
- hr.hospital.visit
- hr.hospital.disease
- hr.hospital.doctor.category

## Views
- Form, List, Kanban
- Calendar & Pivot
- Search filters and grouping

## Security
- Access rights and record rules included

## Purpose
Educational project for learning Odoo development (ORM, views, business logic)